; cone 0.8prelease · include 语法规范化（三种形态）
; 1) include xxx      -> include xxx.inc + includelib xxx.lib
; 2) include xxx.yyy  -> include xxx.yyy（后缀不是 lib，只生成 include 行）
; 3) include xxx.lib  -> includelib xxx.lib（只生成 includelib 行）
; 固定头（windows/kernel32/user32）与这三条走同一套路径策略：
;   默认无 -s 写 cone 安装目录全路径且不带引号；-s 写短名。
include msvcrt
include extra.inc
include mylib.lib
include os.lib

def start(){
    return 0
}

end start
